## v0.29

- Latest test invoices can now be removed after a successful email send.
- Emailed test invoices show a stronger warning that deleting the invoice cannot recall the email already sent.
- Removing the latest emailed test invoice deletes its email-status record and saved PDF copy and rolls its invoice counter back so the test number can be reused.
- Invoices that are currently sending or have uncertain delivery remain protected from deletion and number reuse.
